1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 21=

4
00:01:51,140 --> 00:01:51,620
Your Highness.

5
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:01,020
They let you in?

6
00:02:05,300 --> 00:02:06,180
Liyue...

7
00:02:07,940 --> 00:02:09,060
Where are Yusheng and the others?

8
00:02:11,540 --> 00:02:12,140
Gone.

9
00:02:14,420 --> 00:02:15,820
They're all gone.

10
00:02:26,060 --> 00:02:28,140
I want to go home.

11
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:05,180
Now that you're in North Jing,

12
00:03:05,300 --> 00:03:06,700
you'd better follow our rules!

13
00:03:08,380 --> 00:03:08,820
Look at her!

14
00:03:08,820 --> 00:03:09,420
Give her the wine jug.

15
00:03:09,420 --> 00:03:10,460
You've scared the poor girl to tears!

16
00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:14,740
Go serve wine to my generals.

17
00:03:30,900 --> 00:03:33,500
Why do you keep hovering around Zaishi?

18
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:37,300
Come here.

19
00:03:38,740 --> 00:03:39,500
Pour me a drink.

20
00:03:58,180 --> 00:03:58,900
On your knees.

21
00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:02,100
Kneel!

22
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:11,940
You can't even pour wine?

23
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:13,900
How stupid.

24
00:04:14,780 --> 00:04:16,500
Didn't anyone teach you growing up?

25
00:04:20,500 --> 00:04:21,380
You're right, General.

26
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:23,580
Ever since I was little,

27
00:04:24,380 --> 00:04:25,340
I've had people serving me.

28
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:27,780
Of course I don't know
how to serve wine.

29
00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:32,260
That's easy.

30
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:44,660
I'll teach you.

31
00:04:55,780 --> 00:04:56,860
Nice pour!

32
00:04:57,380 --> 00:04:58,980
- You made her cry!
- I don't care who you are!

33
00:04:59,220 --> 00:05:01,300
Here in North Jing,
you belong to General Meng!

34
00:05:02,820 --> 00:05:04,140
Scared now?

35
00:05:04,660 --> 00:05:05,740
I bet you are!

36
00:05:15,740 --> 00:05:17,260
- Nice pour!
- Tastes good, doesn't it?

37
00:05:33,380 --> 00:05:33,740
Stop.

38
00:05:59,220 --> 00:06:00,460
So eager to die?

39
00:06:01,620 --> 00:06:03,660
You'd better go back to your room

40
00:06:04,580 --> 00:06:06,020
and pretend nothing happened.

41
00:06:07,580 --> 00:06:08,460
If he finds out

42
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:10,140
you've been trying to kill yourself
behind his back...

43
00:06:10,700 --> 00:06:11,940
Don't try to scare me with him.

44
00:06:14,420 --> 00:06:16,020
What can he do to me once I'm dead?

45
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:21,140
You've got quite a mouth
when you're talking to me.

46
00:06:22,780 --> 00:06:24,980
Who was so scared just now
that she wanted to die?

47
00:06:26,300 --> 00:06:27,540
Death would be better than this.

48
00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:30,460
Why should I go on living?

49
00:06:34,460 --> 00:06:35,420
I've heard

50
00:06:36,460 --> 00:06:37,980
that generations of your Mu ancestors

51
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:39,660
were great heroes.

52
00:06:41,820 --> 00:06:43,580
They built the Huai Empire.

53
00:06:44,980 --> 00:06:47,580
So how did their descendants
become such cowards?

54
00:06:49,980 --> 00:06:51,260
Some princess you are.

55
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:53,660
Always throwing fits
and threatening suicide.

56
00:06:55,260 --> 00:06:57,100
Even the lowliest servants in North Jing

57
00:06:58,660 --> 00:07:00,420
have more backbone than you.

58
00:07:02,020 --> 00:07:04,060
No wonder my uncle looks down on you.

59
00:07:06,580 --> 00:07:07,420
I, Mu Wanyao,

60
00:07:09,460 --> 00:07:10,540
don't need his approval.

61
00:07:13,780 --> 00:07:14,980
Why do you think he asked to marry you?

62
00:07:15,860 --> 00:07:16,700
You know exactly what he's after.

63
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:20,460
Instead of blaming everyone here,

64
00:07:21,820 --> 00:07:22,500
why not blame

65
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:24,020
Yu Cheng'an, who sent you here?

66
00:07:26,980 --> 00:07:27,300
And of course,

67
00:07:28,460 --> 00:07:30,540
your spineless father, the Emperor.

68
00:07:30,820 --> 00:07:31,860
Don't you dare speak of my father!

69
00:07:34,020 --> 00:07:35,020
And you think you're any better?

70
00:07:35,620 --> 00:07:37,260
You serve him like a dog,

71
00:07:38,020 --> 00:07:39,020
always taking your cues from him.

72
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:41,220
And he still doesn't trust you.

73
00:07:42,340 --> 00:07:43,700
You've got a filthy mouth.

74
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:45,540
So why didn't you dare

75
00:07:46,300 --> 00:07:47,420
say a word at the banquet?

76
00:07:54,900 --> 00:07:56,700
Don't think I won't kill you!

77
00:07:58,500 --> 00:07:59,620
I don't want to live anyway.

78
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:01,260
You're the one

79
00:08:02,620 --> 00:08:03,780
who keeps interfering.

80
00:08:12,260 --> 00:08:13,860
You're not worth arguing with.

81
00:08:23,700 --> 00:08:24,940
This belonged to the dead.

82
00:08:26,220 --> 00:08:27,620
It's bad luck to keep it on me.

83
00:08:29,260 --> 00:08:29,980
Let it be buried with its onwer.

84
00:08:47,180 --> 00:08:47,660
Your Highness.

85
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:49,460
You're finally back.

86
00:08:50,780 --> 00:08:52,660
I thought you were going to leave me
all alone.

87
00:08:53,900 --> 00:08:54,460
Don't be afraid.

88
00:08:56,820 --> 00:08:57,620
I'm back now.

89
00:09:11,980 --> 00:09:13,100
It's gone quiet.

90
00:09:18,380 --> 00:09:18,940
What?

91
00:09:19,580 --> 00:09:20,420
That bug.

92
00:09:22,900 --> 00:09:23,780
It's not moving anymore.

93
00:09:28,140 --> 00:09:29,180
Is it dead?

94
00:09:40,740 --> 00:09:41,300
Your Highness.

95
00:09:47,300 --> 00:09:47,820
Look.

96
00:09:49,700 --> 00:09:50,620
It got away.

97
00:09:50,620 --> 00:09:56,620
♪A daughter ventures forth,
in the name her father gave♪

98
00:09:56,980 --> 00:10:02,100
♪Into savage lands,
to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

99
00:10:02,100 --> 00:10:02,700
Chunhua.

100
00:10:06,300 --> 00:10:07,780
Do you remember the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors?

101
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:10,660
Your Highness,

102
00:10:11,460 --> 00:10:12,700
I was so young back then.

103
00:10:13,220 --> 00:10:14,460
I grew up in the countryside
with my parents.

104
00:10:15,020 --> 00:10:16,060
I barely remember it.

105
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:20,180
The year Sheng'an fell,

106
00:10:22,060 --> 00:10:22,780
I was nine.

107
00:10:24,340 --> 00:10:25,460
Father, Mother, and I

108
00:10:26,500 --> 00:10:27,660
fled to the Shu region for safety.

109
00:10:30,460 --> 00:10:31,740
Mother was always trying to comfort me,

110
00:10:33,500 --> 00:10:34,660
but deep down, I knew

111
00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:38,380
the world had changed.

112
00:10:38,380 --> 00:10:40,540
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

113
00:10:42,180 --> 00:10:43,940
I missed the swings
in the Imperial Garden,

114
00:10:45,260 --> 00:10:46,980
and the lively crowds
along the Qujiang River.

115
00:10:48,180 --> 00:10:49,300
I secretly wondered...

116
00:10:49,300 --> 00:10:52,340
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

117
00:10:52,380 --> 00:10:54,220
Would I ever get to return to Sheng'an?

118
00:10:55,060 --> 00:10:58,180
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

119
00:10:58,540 --> 00:10:59,660
But just a few years later,

120
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:02,220
Sheng'an was recaptured.

121
00:11:03,260 --> 00:11:03,980
And I made it back.

122
00:11:05,780 --> 00:11:06,300
Chunhua,

123
00:11:07,060 --> 00:11:08,300
I've left Sheng'an before

124
00:11:09,540 --> 00:11:10,660
and made it back.

125
00:11:11,740 --> 00:11:12,380
This time,

126
00:11:13,780 --> 00:11:14,740
I can definitely do it again.

127
00:11:16,380 --> 00:11:18,540
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

128
00:11:18,540 --> 00:11:20,420
We have to make it out alive.

129
00:11:20,420 --> 00:11:22,020
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

130
00:11:22,020 --> 00:11:22,700
And go home.

131
00:11:23,620 --> 00:11:28,380
♪I'll guard my princess,
and keep her tears at bay♪

132
00:13:31,500 --> 00:13:31,860
General.

133
00:13:32,580 --> 00:13:33,140
What is it?

134
00:13:33,700 --> 00:13:35,260
Meng Zaishi has been secretly training
a unit

135
00:13:35,260 --> 00:13:36,140
for the past six months.

136
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:37,460
They train day and night.

137
00:13:38,140 --> 00:13:38,620
I've heard

138
00:13:38,940 --> 00:13:40,540
each man can take on ten opponents.

139
00:13:41,100 --> 00:13:42,380
They specialize in ambushes
and assassinations.

140
00:13:43,180 --> 00:13:44,460
Where did you hear this?

141
00:13:44,660 --> 00:13:45,900
Zuo He told me himself.

142
00:13:46,740 --> 00:13:47,580
He was rescued

143
00:13:47,660 --> 00:13:48,700
by Meng Zaishi on the battlefield.

144
00:13:49,020 --> 00:13:50,260
He's stayed by his side ever since,

145
00:13:50,380 --> 00:13:51,060
guarding him day and night.

146
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:53,580
Meng Zaishi treats him like a brother

147
00:13:53,860 --> 00:13:55,060
and never keeps anything from him.

148
00:13:55,260 --> 00:13:56,700
Then assemble a squad
of personal guards.

149
00:13:57,420 --> 00:13:59,180
Have them stand guard
outside tonight's banquet.

150
00:13:59,740 --> 00:14:00,020
And remember,

151
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:01,740
wait for my orders before acting.

152
00:14:02,180 --> 00:14:02,860
Yes, General.

153
00:14:25,060 --> 00:14:26,300
(With Bold, Majestic Strides)

154
00:14:31,140 --> 00:14:31,580
Come on!

155
00:14:31,940 --> 00:14:32,420
General.

156
00:14:33,420 --> 00:14:35,460
Let me pour a drink
for all the generals today.

157
00:14:37,780 --> 00:14:38,140
Go on.

158
00:14:39,860 --> 00:14:40,300
Here's to you.

159
00:14:40,300 --> 00:14:42,020
- General, have some wine.
- Come on!

160
00:14:42,300 --> 00:14:42,660
Fill it up!

161
00:14:43,060 --> 00:14:43,340
Here!

162
00:14:44,380 --> 00:14:44,780
Bottoms up!

163
00:14:45,300 --> 00:14:45,860
Let's have a drink!

164
00:14:47,060 --> 00:14:47,700
Here, General!

165
00:14:49,860 --> 00:14:50,580
Excellent wine!

166
00:14:51,700 --> 00:14:52,220
Again!

167
00:14:52,220 --> 00:14:53,060
Come on, let's drink! Cheers!

168
00:14:53,220 --> 00:14:54,140
Let's raise our cups!

169
00:14:54,260 --> 00:14:55,180
Pour some more!

170
00:14:55,260 --> 00:14:56,260
Come on, have some meat!

171
00:14:56,260 --> 00:14:56,980
Feed me.

172
00:15:01,140 --> 00:15:01,740
Wonderful!

173
00:15:02,380 --> 00:15:02,620
Good!

174
00:15:02,620 --> 00:15:03,020
Fill it up!

175
00:15:05,220 --> 00:15:06,260
You're in good spirits today, General.

176
00:15:06,500 --> 00:15:07,180
Have a few more drinks!

177
00:15:08,460 --> 00:15:08,780
Here!

178
00:15:09,340 --> 00:15:10,060
Let me toast you again!

179
00:15:17,020 --> 00:15:17,380
Fill it up!

180
00:15:19,820 --> 00:15:20,220
Come on!

181
00:15:22,180 --> 00:15:23,020
(Death to Traitors)
Another toast to you!

182
00:15:23,340 --> 00:15:23,620
All right!

183
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:25,180
Come on!

184
00:15:26,740 --> 00:15:27,340
Drink up!

185
00:15:28,140 --> 00:15:28,420
Good!

186
00:15:28,620 --> 00:15:28,900
Good!

187
00:15:38,100 --> 00:15:41,980
(With Bold, Majestic Strides)

188
00:15:46,540 --> 00:15:47,100
General,

189
00:15:47,860 --> 00:15:48,660
enjoy yourself.

190
00:15:49,740 --> 00:15:50,740
I'm getting tired.

191
00:15:51,580 --> 00:15:52,540
I'll go back to my room

192
00:15:53,020 --> 00:15:53,420
and wait for you.

193
00:15:58,060 --> 00:15:58,420
All right.

194
00:16:22,620 --> 00:16:23,020
Uncle,

195
00:16:24,020 --> 00:16:24,980
there's something I need to tell you.

196
00:16:25,940 --> 00:16:26,740
Let's hear it.

197
00:16:27,700 --> 00:16:29,260
Your 50th birthday is coming up.

198
00:16:30,420 --> 00:16:31,420
I've given it a lot of thought.

199
00:16:33,060 --> 00:16:34,740
You now command two military districts
in North Jing.

200
00:16:35,460 --> 00:16:37,220
Fine weapons, prized horses,
beautiful women...

201
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:38,620
You have everything.

202
00:16:39,820 --> 00:16:40,580
I couldn't think

203
00:16:41,260 --> 00:16:42,540
of a suitable birthday gift.

204
00:16:43,100 --> 00:16:44,020
So?

205
00:16:47,100 --> 00:16:48,780
Lord Mengchang once had
three thousand retainers.

206
00:16:50,860 --> 00:16:51,580
And now that you

207
00:16:52,900 --> 00:16:53,780
rule an entire region,

208
00:16:54,980 --> 00:16:56,380
the more talented men you have,
the better.

209
00:16:57,500 --> 00:16:58,580
So six months ago,

210
00:16:58,820 --> 00:17:00,660
I began recruiting and training
skilled fighters myself.

211
00:17:01,540 --> 00:17:02,780
My plan was to present them to you

212
00:17:03,020 --> 00:17:03,780
on your birthday

213
00:17:04,500 --> 00:17:05,460
to repay you for raising me.

214
00:17:06,140 --> 00:17:08,020
That's certainly an unusual
birthday gift.

215
00:17:10,100 --> 00:17:11,980
But you've kept it secret
for six months.

216
00:17:13,020 --> 00:17:14,980
Why couldn't you keep it

217
00:17:15,540 --> 00:17:16,860
to yourself any longer?

218
00:17:20,580 --> 00:17:21,780
I made the mistake
of trusting the wrong man.

219
00:17:22,180 --> 00:17:23,580
Someone close to me
has been spreading lies

220
00:17:24,940 --> 00:17:25,780
and making false accusations.

221
00:17:27,740 --> 00:17:28,860
I was worried,

222
00:17:29,620 --> 00:17:30,580
so I decided to tell you myself.

223
00:17:32,780 --> 00:17:33,900
I hope you'll see the truth, Uncle.

224
00:17:40,700 --> 00:17:41,900
If I, Meng Zaishi, ever betray you,

225
00:17:42,860 --> 00:17:43,700
may I end up like this sword!

226
00:18:25,420 --> 00:18:26,260
Get up.

227
00:18:32,700 --> 00:18:33,860
Zaishi,

228
00:18:35,300 --> 00:18:36,700
you're still such a child.

229
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:40,180
If someone's just trying
to turn me against you,

230
00:18:42,020 --> 00:18:43,420
why would I believe them?

231
00:18:52,100 --> 00:18:52,700
Go sit down.

232
00:19:11,020 --> 00:19:11,740
Thank you for tonight.

233
00:19:29,100 --> 00:19:29,660
Does it hurt?

234
00:19:31,580 --> 00:19:32,180
I'm a soldier.

235
00:19:32,900 --> 00:19:33,860
A little wound like this is nothing.

236
00:19:41,100 --> 00:19:42,260
Even a small wound

237
00:19:43,300 --> 00:19:44,300
can still hurt.

238
00:19:47,900 --> 00:19:49,260
Please don't let yourself
get hurt again.

239
00:19:55,700 --> 00:19:56,940
What are you really after?

240
00:19:57,540 --> 00:19:58,580
I'm not after anything.

241
00:20:00,620 --> 00:20:02,220
I saw that you were hurt

242
00:20:03,580 --> 00:20:04,780
and felt sorry for you.

243
00:20:09,380 --> 00:20:10,620
I know what it's like to suffer.
That's all.

244
00:20:13,940 --> 00:20:14,900
I'm just like you.

245
00:20:16,020 --> 00:20:16,860
When I'm wounded,

246
00:20:18,060 --> 00:20:18,740
it hurts me too.

247
00:20:46,540 --> 00:20:48,140
You risked sending me word tonight.

248
00:20:50,820 --> 00:20:52,060
If he finds out...

249
00:20:52,100 --> 00:20:53,180
Don't you understand?

250
00:20:57,260 --> 00:20:58,500
If he wants me dead,

251
00:20:59,900 --> 00:21:01,820
he can kill me
whenever he feels like it.

252
00:21:02,540 --> 00:21:03,580
He doesn't need an excuse.

253
00:21:04,540 --> 00:21:05,740
It doesn't matter.

254
00:21:06,620 --> 00:21:07,940
It's not up to me anyway.

255
00:21:10,060 --> 00:21:10,900
Just like tonight.

256
00:21:12,100 --> 00:21:13,020
Whether you lived or died

257
00:21:14,180 --> 00:21:15,940
wasn't up to you either.

258
00:21:39,340 --> 00:21:40,140
You know,

259
00:21:42,140 --> 00:21:43,420
the day I arrived
in the Central Circuit,

260
00:21:45,540 --> 00:21:46,820
you rode in to snatch me away.

261
00:21:48,980 --> 00:21:50,260
I'd never seen

262
00:21:51,460 --> 00:21:53,100
a man so tall and brave before.

263
00:22:03,860 --> 00:22:04,860
For a moment, I thought

264
00:22:06,700 --> 00:22:07,980
you were the man I was marrying.

265
00:22:21,220 --> 00:22:22,420
Who sent you?

266
00:22:22,860 --> 00:22:24,060
Why are you telling me all this?

267
00:22:29,740 --> 00:22:30,380
You think

268
00:22:32,220 --> 00:22:33,420
Meng Baiyu sent me

269
00:22:34,140 --> 00:22:35,180
to test your loyalty?

270
00:22:48,540 --> 00:22:49,260
Meng Zaishi,

271
00:22:50,740 --> 00:22:51,900
you were born to be a powerful leader.

272
00:22:53,060 --> 00:22:53,780
Don't tell me

273
00:22:55,620 --> 00:22:56,620
a man like you

274
00:22:58,100 --> 00:23:00,820
would spend his whole life
risking his neck for him.

275
00:23:06,380 --> 00:23:07,260
Mu Wanyao,

276
00:23:08,900 --> 00:23:10,420
you've been putting on an act
all this time

277
00:23:11,700 --> 00:23:13,420
just to stay alive.

278
00:23:17,300 --> 00:23:19,460
Aren't you afraid I'll tell my uncle
what you said?

279
00:23:20,220 --> 00:23:20,660
Really?

280
00:23:23,980 --> 00:23:25,140
Would you dare tell him?

281
00:23:26,660 --> 00:23:27,860
Confirm his worst fears

282
00:23:28,780 --> 00:23:29,940
and bring his suspicions into the open?

283
00:23:31,780 --> 00:23:32,660
You share

284
00:23:33,100 --> 00:23:33,780
the Meng family name.

285
00:23:35,140 --> 00:23:36,060
And you command an army

286
00:23:37,300 --> 00:23:38,700
that's loyal to the Meng family.

287
00:23:38,700 --> 00:23:39,220
Shut up!

288
00:23:47,020 --> 00:23:48,140
You suddenly

289
00:23:49,580 --> 00:23:50,660
lashed out at me just now.

290
00:23:52,340 --> 00:23:53,020
Could it be

291
00:23:53,620 --> 00:23:54,980
I struck a nerve?

292
00:24:02,940 --> 00:24:03,860
My skin

293
00:24:05,060 --> 00:24:06,500
bruises easily.

294
00:24:07,900 --> 00:24:08,780
Just now,

295
00:24:09,300 --> 00:24:10,500
you grabbed me so hard.

296
00:24:11,020 --> 00:24:12,540
If Meng Baiyu notices

297
00:24:13,060 --> 00:24:14,740
these marks weren't left by him,

298
00:24:15,980 --> 00:24:16,940
what am I supposed to say?

299
00:24:18,820 --> 00:24:20,580
You really have a death wish.

300
00:24:21,940 --> 00:24:23,940
My uncle hates betrayal
more than anything.

301
00:24:24,820 --> 00:24:25,940
If he ever finds out,

302
00:24:27,140 --> 00:24:27,820
death

303
00:24:28,900 --> 00:24:30,900
would be the best you could hope for.

304
00:24:35,300 --> 00:24:35,820
What about you?

305
00:24:38,860 --> 00:24:39,740
Do you hate betrayal too?

306
00:24:41,260 --> 00:24:43,260
I heard Zuo He betrayed you.

307
00:24:44,540 --> 00:24:45,580
You were like brothers.

308
00:24:48,900 --> 00:24:49,780
I'll kill him.

309
00:25:02,700 --> 00:25:03,180
Your Highness,

310
00:25:04,020 --> 00:25:05,740
we're surrounded by enemies.

311
00:25:06,380 --> 00:25:07,260
I don't think Meng Zaishi

312
00:25:07,260 --> 00:25:08,300
is any better than the others.

313
00:25:08,700 --> 00:25:09,780
Please don't count on him.

314
00:25:11,500 --> 00:25:13,780
You and I are trapped
in this living hell.

315
00:25:14,820 --> 00:25:15,780
I'll try anything,

316
00:25:16,580 --> 00:25:17,780
as long as there's
even the slightest chance

317
00:25:18,220 --> 00:25:19,060
we can make it out alive.

318
00:25:20,340 --> 00:25:21,100
Besides,

319
00:25:21,860 --> 00:25:23,380
Meng Zaishi gives us a real chance.

320
00:25:24,300 --> 00:25:25,460
It's a risk I have to take.

321
00:25:33,700 --> 00:25:34,740
If I get another chance,

322
00:25:36,060 --> 00:25:36,900
I'll keep trying.

323
00:25:37,900 --> 00:25:39,500
I know you're using yourself as bait.

324
00:25:40,300 --> 00:25:41,540
But after the way he treated you,

325
00:25:41,660 --> 00:25:42,860
it's clear he hasn't taken it.

326
00:25:43,180 --> 00:25:44,020
Why keep trying?

327
00:25:46,260 --> 00:25:47,660
Meng Baiyu is cruel and bloodthirsty.

328
00:25:47,980 --> 00:25:48,940
He makes no effort to hide his emotions.

329
00:25:50,220 --> 00:25:51,260
But Meng Zaishi

330
00:25:51,620 --> 00:25:52,700
is a different kind of beast.

331
00:25:53,740 --> 00:25:55,220
He thinks he's hiding it well,

332
00:25:55,820 --> 00:25:56,700
but I can see

333
00:25:57,060 --> 00:25:58,260
the wolf's tail

334
00:25:58,540 --> 00:25:59,580
beneath that dog's hide of his.

335
00:26:00,500 --> 00:26:01,540
He's meant for greater things.

336
00:26:02,260 --> 00:26:03,060
He won't be anyone's lapdog

337
00:26:04,060 --> 00:26:04,700
for long.

338
00:26:07,020 --> 00:26:08,220
As for what he's really thinking,

339
00:26:09,020 --> 00:26:09,740
I wasn't

340
00:26:10,100 --> 00:26:11,380
completely sure before.

341
00:26:12,340 --> 00:26:13,100
But today,

342
00:26:13,900 --> 00:26:15,060
he finally lost his composure.

343
00:26:15,860 --> 00:26:16,620
Now I know for sure.

344
00:26:17,020 --> 00:26:17,700
He's taken the bait.

345
00:26:19,500 --> 00:26:20,780
I bet he's

346
00:26:21,340 --> 00:26:22,540
tossing and turning right now.

347
00:26:31,260 --> 00:26:31,580
Leave us.

348
00:26:32,900 --> 00:26:33,420
Are you insane?

349
00:26:34,820 --> 00:26:35,900
How could you come here on your own?

350
00:26:38,180 --> 00:26:39,020
These past few days,

351
00:26:39,740 --> 00:26:41,420
I've sent Chunhua to fetch you
several times,

352
00:26:41,900 --> 00:26:42,860
but you never came.

353
00:26:43,540 --> 00:26:44,660
So I had to come myself.

354
00:26:44,940 --> 00:26:45,780
Nobody saw you, did they?

355
00:26:46,220 --> 00:26:47,260
So what if they did?

356
00:26:48,780 --> 00:26:50,180
Meng Baiyu favors me now.

357
00:26:50,500 --> 00:26:52,220
I've visited plenty of his men's homes.

358
00:26:53,180 --> 00:26:54,500
As long as I stay
in the Central Circuit,

359
00:26:54,580 --> 00:26:55,740
he lets me go wherever I please.

360
00:27:01,180 --> 00:27:02,380
What I suggested the other day...

361
00:27:03,140 --> 00:27:04,500
Won't you even consider it?

362
00:27:06,380 --> 00:27:07,220
Your plan

363
00:27:07,660 --> 00:27:08,580
would get a lot of people killed.

364
00:27:09,220 --> 00:27:11,020
And how many people have you killed
on the battlefield?

365
00:27:13,900 --> 00:27:15,060
You clearly don't care about that.

366
00:27:20,620 --> 00:27:21,060
Fine.

367
00:27:23,900 --> 00:27:24,860
I guess I misjudged you.

368
00:27:27,420 --> 00:27:28,060
So what now?

369
00:27:29,300 --> 00:27:31,060
Going to find another man to seduce?

370
00:27:33,140 --> 00:27:34,420
How can you say that?

371
00:27:35,860 --> 00:27:36,820
You know how I've treated you.

372
00:27:38,140 --> 00:27:39,700
Don't tell me you haven't noticed.

373
00:27:43,540 --> 00:27:44,500
I know you value loyalty

374
00:27:45,300 --> 00:27:45,980
and don't want to act.

375
00:27:46,980 --> 00:27:48,220
But I can't bear

376
00:27:48,580 --> 00:27:50,060
another day sharing a bed

377
00:27:50,060 --> 00:27:50,980
with a man I don't love.

378
00:27:56,460 --> 00:27:57,060
Meng Zaishi,

379
00:27:58,260 --> 00:27:59,380
if you won't act for your own sake,

380
00:28:00,420 --> 00:28:01,980
then help Chunhua and me escape.

381
00:28:04,500 --> 00:28:05,660
What makes you think

382
00:28:06,540 --> 00:28:07,420
I'd help you?

383
00:28:08,300 --> 00:28:09,340
The fact that I'm standing here.

384
00:28:11,100 --> 00:28:11,740
It means

385
00:28:12,780 --> 00:28:14,180
you never told Meng Baiyu

386
00:28:14,180 --> 00:28:15,060
what I said that day.

387
00:28:15,900 --> 00:28:16,540
That tells me

388
00:28:17,700 --> 00:28:19,420
you do care whether I live or die.

389
00:28:22,020 --> 00:28:22,740
After tomorrow,

390
00:28:23,700 --> 00:28:24,780
we'll have our chance.

391
00:28:25,660 --> 00:28:26,380
What have you found out?

392
00:28:27,980 --> 00:28:28,500
Tomorrow,

393
00:28:29,620 --> 00:28:30,780
Meng Baiyu is taking his troops

394
00:28:31,460 --> 00:28:32,500
to inspect the border.

395
00:28:33,860 --> 00:28:35,180
He'll be gone for ten days,
maybe two weeks.

396
00:28:42,900 --> 00:28:43,980
If I let you go,

397
00:28:45,380 --> 00:28:46,340
there's too much at stake.

398
00:28:47,780 --> 00:28:49,740
It's a long way.
If you never return...

399
00:28:55,940 --> 00:28:56,900
What's in it for me?

400
00:29:11,420 --> 00:29:13,740
What would you like in return, General?

401
00:29:27,540 --> 00:29:29,220
Your belt seems to be

402
00:29:30,260 --> 00:29:31,740
missing a silk handkerchief.

403
00:29:33,780 --> 00:29:34,900
If Meng Baiyu

404
00:29:35,580 --> 00:29:37,380
found it beside my pillow,

405
00:29:38,980 --> 00:29:40,180
should I tell him

406
00:29:40,620 --> 00:29:41,380
it's yours?

407
00:29:44,660 --> 00:29:45,780
How dare you threaten me?

408
00:29:46,380 --> 00:29:47,780
You won't kill Meng Baiyu,

409
00:29:48,740 --> 00:29:49,860
and you won't help me
get back to Sheng'an.

410
00:29:50,220 --> 00:29:50,860
What choice do I have?

411
00:29:51,900 --> 00:29:54,460
Am I supposed to grow old with him here?

412
00:29:55,020 --> 00:29:55,780
You really think

413
00:29:55,780 --> 00:29:57,660
you can blackmail me
with a handkerchief?

414
00:29:58,540 --> 00:30:00,540
If he believes we're having an affair,

415
00:30:02,460 --> 00:30:04,100
which of us do you think

416
00:30:06,140 --> 00:30:07,420
will suffer more?

417
00:30:07,900 --> 00:30:09,180
Then I'll make sure
to embellish the story

418
00:30:09,740 --> 00:30:10,780
and take you down with me.

419
00:30:12,940 --> 00:30:14,780
If I can't return to Sheng'an,

420
00:30:16,020 --> 00:30:17,900
my life's already over anyway.

421
00:30:19,100 --> 00:30:19,900
But you, General,

422
00:30:20,740 --> 00:30:21,580
have a bright future ahead of you.

423
00:30:22,460 --> 00:30:24,140
If you go down with someone
as good as dead,

424
00:30:24,540 --> 00:30:25,220
I'd call that a fair trade.

425
00:30:35,420 --> 00:30:37,060
There's no doubt about it.
You're pregnant.

426
00:30:37,180 --> 00:30:37,940
I'm certain.

427
00:30:38,340 --> 00:30:39,220
Congratulations, my lady.

428
00:30:48,660 --> 00:30:49,460
Why?

429
00:31:15,940 --> 00:31:17,340
(Those mercury-laced pills...)

430
00:31:18,060 --> 00:31:19,420
(I've taken them every three days.)

431
00:31:19,820 --> 00:31:20,860
(I've never missed a dose.)

432
00:31:21,980 --> 00:31:24,100
(Why would heaven play
such a cruel trick on me?)

433
00:31:42,340 --> 00:31:43,300
You're dying.

434
00:31:48,820 --> 00:31:50,020
But I want to live.

435
00:31:50,780 --> 00:31:51,700
So you came to me

436
00:31:52,820 --> 00:31:54,100
because you think I can save you?

437
00:31:56,660 --> 00:31:57,660
Please, General Meng.

438
00:31:58,260 --> 00:31:59,420
Save Her Highness!

439
00:32:00,660 --> 00:32:01,580
I'm begging you.

440
00:32:03,140 --> 00:32:04,100
I thought

441
00:32:06,500 --> 00:32:07,900
you'd rather have me alive

442
00:32:10,540 --> 00:32:12,180
than dead.

443
00:32:12,900 --> 00:32:13,620
The fact that I care about you

444
00:32:14,140 --> 00:32:15,060
might save your life.

445
00:32:16,180 --> 00:32:16,860
Or...

446
00:32:17,940 --> 00:32:19,380
it might just get you killed.

447
00:32:23,260 --> 00:32:24,460
But you're lucky tonight.

448
00:32:27,420 --> 00:32:28,260
My feelings for you

449
00:32:30,900 --> 00:32:31,820
will save your life.

450
00:32:36,620 --> 00:32:38,100
Then I'm grateful for your feelings

451
00:32:40,060 --> 00:32:41,380
and for my good luck.

452
00:32:49,540 --> 00:32:50,940
This antidote is made from jade poria.

453
00:32:51,900 --> 00:32:52,780
I happen to have one pill.

454
00:32:55,460 --> 00:32:56,220
You're very lucky.

455
00:32:59,980 --> 00:33:01,780
I've heard of that prescription
you mentioned.

456
00:33:04,060 --> 00:33:06,220
But once you take this antidote,

457
00:33:07,660 --> 00:33:09,060
it won't just save your life.

458
00:33:13,260 --> 00:33:15,060
It'll save your unborn child, too.

459
00:33:43,100 --> 00:33:43,620
Your Highness.

460
00:33:45,140 --> 00:33:45,860
Mu Wanyao!

461
00:33:47,060 --> 00:33:48,020
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

462
00:33:48,960 --> 00:33:50,780
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

463
00:33:50,780 --> 00:33:51,460
I do.

464
00:33:52,680 --> 00:33:54,340
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

465
00:33:54,340 --> 00:33:55,180
But tonight,

466
00:33:57,420 --> 00:33:58,980
only one of us gets to live.

467
00:34:00,500 --> 00:34:02,420
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

468
00:34:02,420 --> 00:34:03,740
And that will be me.

469
00:34:03,740 --> 00:34:06,220
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

470
00:34:06,540 --> 00:34:07,300
Good luck.

471
00:34:07,300 --> 00:34:09,460
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

472
00:34:10,140 --> 00:34:14,180
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

473
00:34:14,340 --> 00:34:17,140
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

474
00:34:17,180 --> 00:34:23,420
♪Through fire, I'll turn the
dark towers bright as day for you♪

475
00:34:24,060 --> 00:34:27,860
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

476
00:34:27,980 --> 00:34:31,060
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

477
00:34:31,300 --> 00:34:34,970
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

478
00:34:34,970 --> 00:34:40,180
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

479
00:34:43,300 --> 00:34:43,740
Mother...

480
00:34:47,620 --> 00:34:48,380
Take me...

481
00:34:49,140 --> 00:34:50,300
Take me home.

482
00:34:50,300 --> 00:34:54,280
♪A tooth for a tooth;
A scar for a scar♪

483
00:34:54,280 --> 00:34:57,460
♪A tooth for a tooth;
A scar for a scar♪

484
00:34:58,220 --> 00:35:01,620
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

485
00:35:04,900 --> 00:35:05,340
Your Highness!

486
00:35:16,900 --> 00:35:18,260
Looks like my gamble paid off.

487
00:35:23,980 --> 00:35:25,180
How long was I unconscious?

488
00:35:26,660 --> 00:35:27,660
Two days and two nights.

489
00:35:29,260 --> 00:35:31,900
The Military Headquarters' physician
came to check your pulse yesterday.

490
00:35:32,940 --> 00:35:33,740
I couldn't stop him.

491
00:35:35,420 --> 00:35:37,060
Then he'll find out soon enough.

492
00:35:38,780 --> 00:35:39,420
Chunhua,

493
00:35:42,140 --> 00:35:43,100
take all this bedding

494
00:35:43,820 --> 00:35:44,620
and these bloodstained clothes

495
00:35:45,140 --> 00:35:46,020
and burn them.

496
00:35:48,540 --> 00:35:49,860
Help me wash up and get dressed.

497
00:36:24,380 --> 00:36:24,820
Darling...

498
00:36:26,140 --> 00:36:26,580
Darling...

499
00:36:28,100 --> 00:36:29,140
I've failed you.

500
00:36:32,100 --> 00:36:33,060
You worthless wretch!

501
00:36:33,460 --> 00:36:35,220
Even animals can give birth!

502
00:36:36,020 --> 00:36:37,460
You're worse than an animal!

503
00:36:44,140 --> 00:36:46,020
If I hadn't fallen
for those lies back then,

504
00:36:46,980 --> 00:36:49,620
I'd never have spared
your worthless life!

505
00:36:53,580 --> 00:36:54,140
Darling...

506
00:37:01,380 --> 00:37:02,220
Darling...

507
00:37:03,860 --> 00:37:04,860
Darling...

508
00:37:07,420 --> 00:37:08,220
Darling...

509
00:37:09,980 --> 00:37:10,580
Darling...

510
00:37:12,660 --> 00:37:13,580
The pregnancy was unstable.

511
00:37:14,580 --> 00:37:15,700
I'm devastated too.

512
00:37:17,100 --> 00:37:18,140
I can still have...

513
00:37:20,460 --> 00:37:21,420
What future?

514
00:37:22,540 --> 00:37:24,380
You think you still have a future?

515
00:37:25,140 --> 00:37:26,620
I'm the good omen of Huai!

516
00:37:26,620 --> 00:37:27,460
Nonsense!

517
00:37:27,980 --> 00:37:29,260
You're a liar!

518
00:37:29,660 --> 00:37:30,980
So is your father!

519
00:37:30,980 --> 00:37:32,700
And Yu Cheng'an's the biggest liar
of all!

520
00:37:33,140 --> 00:37:34,100
Once I've killed you,

521
00:37:34,100 --> 00:37:35,940
I'll march my army south to Sheng'an

522
00:37:36,180 --> 00:37:37,980
and wipe every last one of you out!

523
00:39:17,980 --> 00:39:18,580
You're safe now.

524
00:39:26,940 --> 00:39:27,860
You were right.

525
00:39:29,020 --> 00:39:30,060
I survived.

526
00:39:40,900 --> 00:39:42,300
But my uncle came back tonight.

527
00:39:43,620 --> 00:39:44,420
How did you get out?

528
00:39:51,420 --> 00:39:52,580
I have a very special gift for you.

529
00:39:55,660 --> 00:39:56,300
What have you done?

530
00:39:57,100 --> 00:39:57,860
Where's Meng Baiyu?

531
00:39:58,580 --> 00:39:59,900
He's in my room, of course.

532
00:40:01,980 --> 00:40:02,780
Though by now,

533
00:40:04,700 --> 00:40:06,300
he's probably dead.

534
00:40:12,780 --> 00:40:13,420
You did this?

535
00:40:14,620 --> 00:40:15,300
He's dead.

536
00:40:17,620 --> 00:40:18,220
For now,

537
00:40:19,020 --> 00:40:20,860
only heaven, you, and I know.

538
00:40:21,740 --> 00:40:22,780
No one else knows.

539
00:40:25,140 --> 00:40:26,020
Why tell me?

540
00:40:26,900 --> 00:40:27,860
With Meng Baiyu dead,

541
00:40:29,100 --> 00:40:29,980
you're not the only one

542
00:40:30,580 --> 00:40:31,820
who wants his position.

543
00:40:33,020 --> 00:40:33,580
Soon,

544
00:40:34,860 --> 00:40:36,300
all of the Central Circuit
will be in mourning.

545
00:40:37,460 --> 00:40:39,580
What will become
of the Military Headquarters?

546
00:40:40,500 --> 00:40:41,620
Who will take his place?

547
00:40:42,660 --> 00:40:43,500
We'll have our answers

548
00:40:44,060 --> 00:40:45,020
within a few days.

549
00:40:47,020 --> 00:40:47,860
Speed is everything in war.

550
00:40:49,700 --> 00:40:50,340
Meng Zaishi,

551
00:40:52,660 --> 00:40:53,420
you're the only one

552
00:40:53,860 --> 00:40:55,220
I can count on now.

553
00:41:05,100 --> 00:41:05,700
Mu Wanyao,

554
00:41:07,500 --> 00:41:09,260
my temper is no better
than Meng Baiyu's.

555
00:41:11,300 --> 00:41:12,140
If you dare lie to me,

556
00:41:12,140 --> 00:41:13,340
you're dead. Got it?

557
00:41:15,580 --> 00:41:16,300
Meng Zaishi,

558
00:41:17,260 --> 00:41:18,260
why would I lie to you?

559
00:41:19,660 --> 00:41:20,460
In all of North Jing,

560
00:41:21,100 --> 00:41:21,740
who else

561
00:41:22,460 --> 00:41:23,780
would help me but you?

562
00:41:25,140 --> 00:41:25,900
Meng Zaishi,

563
00:41:26,900 --> 00:41:28,100
I'm putting

564
00:41:28,860 --> 00:41:30,140
my life in your hands.

565
00:41:38,260 --> 00:41:38,980
Right now,

566
00:41:39,820 --> 00:41:40,980
his body is in my room.

567
00:41:42,820 --> 00:41:43,780
What should I do?

568
00:41:48,500 --> 00:41:49,620
By the Central Circuit custom,

569
00:41:51,900 --> 00:41:52,820
a wife who bears no children

570
00:41:54,300 --> 00:41:55,780
must be buried with her husband.

571
00:41:58,260 --> 00:41:58,980
Unless...

572
00:42:00,820 --> 00:42:02,100
you become the new military governor.

573
00:42:04,060 --> 00:42:04,620
Meng Zaishi,

574
00:42:05,260 --> 00:42:06,060
marry me.

575
00:42:10,140 --> 00:42:10,940
Answer me.

576
00:42:12,620 --> 00:42:13,580
I'll marry you.

577
00:42:18,780 --> 00:42:19,780
I'll wait for you right here.

578
00:42:21,060 --> 00:42:22,060
I'll be waiting for good news.

579
00:42:23,700 --> 00:42:24,380
Give me three days.

580
00:42:26,460 --> 00:42:27,540
I'll take control
of the Central Circuit.

581
00:42:28,780 --> 00:42:30,540
Once everything's settled,
I'll come back for you.

582
00:42:31,780 --> 00:42:32,300
All right.

583
00:42:34,660 --> 00:42:35,380
I'll wait for you.

584
00:43:03,260 --> 00:43:04,060
This hairpin

585
00:43:07,020 --> 00:43:07,980
will be our token of love.

586
00:43:16,340 --> 00:43:16,780
All right.

587
00:43:17,740 --> 00:43:18,900
Be careful, Young General.

588
00:43:19,460 --> 00:43:19,740
No. I mean...

589
00:43:22,020 --> 00:43:22,620
General.

590
00:43:52,300 --> 00:43:53,220
The fish tally is gone!

591
00:43:57,340 --> 00:43:58,940
Mu Wanyao!

592
00:44:43,380 --> 00:44:44,500
I'm here on the governor's orders

593
00:44:45,220 --> 00:44:46,900
to buy medicine for his wife
outside the city.

594
00:44:49,220 --> 00:44:50,340
Here's the general's fish tally.

595
00:44:54,900 --> 00:44:55,500
Let them through!

596
00:45:10,140 --> 00:45:10,620
Your Highness,

597
00:45:11,260 --> 00:45:12,140
can you keep going?

598
00:45:12,660 --> 00:45:13,220
I'll be fine.

599
00:45:13,900 --> 00:45:15,780
What if the young general
realizes you tricked him

600
00:45:16,060 --> 00:45:17,100
and sends men after us?

601
00:45:17,380 --> 00:45:18,260
Meng Baiyu has just died.

602
00:45:19,020 --> 00:45:21,380
All of North Jing will soon be in chaos.

603
00:45:22,100 --> 00:45:24,300
For Meng Zaishi to take
his uncle's place,

604
00:45:25,020 --> 00:45:26,020
win the army's loyalty

605
00:45:26,180 --> 00:45:26,980
and bring every faction
under his control,

606
00:45:27,420 --> 00:45:28,860
it'll take more than a few days.

607
00:45:29,980 --> 00:45:31,340
Even if he discovers I'm gone,

608
00:45:32,780 --> 00:45:35,020
he can't afford to get sidetracked
chasing me.

609
00:45:36,060 --> 00:45:36,940
What he wants more than a woman

610
00:45:37,820 --> 00:45:39,740
is the governor's seat.

611
00:45:40,100 --> 00:45:41,060
And a witness who's disappeared...

612
00:45:41,700 --> 00:45:42,980
By the time things settle
at the Military Headquarters,

613
00:45:43,740 --> 00:45:44,820
we'll be long gone
from the Central Circuit.

614
00:45:49,260 --> 00:45:49,700
(Goodbye,)

615
00:45:50,340 --> 00:45:50,780
(North Jing.)

616
00:46:06,700 --> 00:46:11,380
(Next Episode Preview)

617
00:46:11,940 --> 00:46:12,740
You really care about him, huh?

618
00:46:13,660 --> 00:46:14,580
You came to see me

619
00:46:15,180 --> 00:46:15,940
without first attending court.

620
00:46:16,420 --> 00:46:17,380
That's a serious offense itself.

621
00:46:17,820 --> 00:46:19,340
If someone gets killed in my residence,

622
00:46:19,540 --> 00:46:20,740
do you think you'll make it back
to North Jing?

623
00:46:21,100 --> 00:46:21,740
Who's there?

624
00:46:22,380 --> 00:46:22,940
It's me.

625
00:46:28,560 --> 00:46:31,853
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

626
00:46:34,538 --> 00:46:39,454
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

627
00:46:41,648 --> 00:46:47,493
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

628
00:46:47,993 --> 00:46:53,219
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

629
00:46:55,988 --> 00:47:00,779
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

630
00:47:01,615 --> 00:47:07,694
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

631
00:47:09,495 --> 00:47:12,645
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

632
00:47:12,645 --> 00:47:14,293
♪Burning bright as a song♪

633
00:47:14,345 --> 00:47:18,069
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

634
00:47:18,447 --> 00:47:23,113
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

635
00:47:23,732 --> 00:47:27,773
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

636
00:47:28,264 --> 00:47:30,379
♪Not a single hour less♪

637
00:47:30,419 --> 00:47:37,365
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

638
00:47:38,128 --> 00:47:41,581
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

639
00:47:41,761 --> 00:47:44,906
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

640
00:47:45,345 --> 00:47:51,982
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

641
00:47:52,379 --> 00:47:54,417
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

642
00:47:54,417 --> 00:47:56,893
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

643
00:47:56,931 --> 00:47:59,400
♪You're the only one I need♪

644
00:47:59,604 --> 00:48:06,491
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

645
00:48:06,803 --> 00:48:10,074
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

646
00:48:10,379 --> 00:48:13,552
♪My last untouched innocence♪

647
00:48:13,876 --> 00:48:17,302
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

648
00:48:17,535 --> 00:48:20,760
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

649
00:48:21,091 --> 00:48:27,887
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

650
00:48:28,256 --> 00:48:30,318
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

651
00:48:30,319 --> 00:48:32,822
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

652
00:48:32,869 --> 00:48:35,207
♪You're the only one I need♪

653
00:48:35,438 --> 00:48:42,273
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

654
00:48:42,622 --> 00:48:44,240
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

655
00:48:44,370 --> 00:48:46,166
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

656
00:48:46,523 --> 00:48:49,540
♪You're the only one I need♪

657
00:48:49,580 --> 00:48:50,907
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
